  "details": "Theres an open source frame generation tool available for a while now that is specifically made for VR called VectorXR.\n\nThis tool seems to run great on many VR Titles(not all but many). And itd be neat to be able to use that in VRChat, however as it does inject itself into the game I fear it could lead to a ban by EAC.\n\nTherefore Id like to request a whitelist of said tool\n\nLink below\n\nhttps://github.com/DienerTech/vectorxr/releases/tag/v0.20.0\n\nJust to be clear, I have not tested this yet with VRChat due to the risk of a potential account ban but would love to be able to.",
